# The Markdown files of the tree, one glob a line. A `*` stands for any run of
# characters within one segment of a path. The rule `markdown` of
# `crates/workflow-tree-rules` refuses each tracked Markdown file that no glob
# matches: its prose goes into rustdoc.
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
crates/README.md
crates/*/README.md
contrib/*/README.md
library/*/README.md
ledger/README.md
ledger/census.md
.config/issues/templates/*.md
corpus/sketch/*/*.gandr.md
.github/pull_request_template.md
